    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102492" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσ-όομαι</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρρόομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be like basket-work, to be
				matted</i>, of roots, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.23.3
			</span></i>; of the reticulation of veins, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὴν ὅλην κεφαλὴν ἐκτετάρσωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Oss.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεταρσωμέναι μασχάλαι</span>, of
			plants <i>with pinnatifid leaves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.156
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετ. ναῦς</span>
			<i>with its oars complete</i> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				3.9.38
			</span></i>.</div>
